{"seq":1,"slug":"indexeddb-fundamentals","title":"IndexedDB 基础","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/offline-data/indexeddb-fundamentals","wordCount":2060,"readingTime":9,"html":"<h1 id=\"indexeddb-基础\">IndexedDB 基础</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>IndexedDB 是浏览器内置的 NoSQL 数据库——支持结构化存储、数 GB 容量、异步 API 和索引查询。它是离线优先 PWA 的主要数据存储方案：HTTP 响应缓存使用 Cache API，而用户生成的应用数据则使用 IndexedDB。然而，原生 API 存在回调地狱和事务管理复杂的问题，现代开发推荐使用封装库——Dexie.js、idb（Jake Archibald 开发）、PouchDB（内置同步能力），让使用变得简单直观。本节涵盖 IndexedDB 核心概念、与 localStorage 的区别、原生 API 用法、主流封装库、以及数据模式设计。</p>\n<table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>存储方式</th>\n<th>类型</th>\n<th>容量</th>\n<th>同步/异步</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>localStorage</td>\n<td>键值对</td>\n<td>5-10 MB</td>\n<td>同步</td>\n<td>简单标志位、设置项</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>sessionStorage</td>\n<td>键值对</td>\n<td>5-10 MB</td>\n<td>同步</td>\n<td>会话级临时数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cookie</td>\n<td>键值对</td>\n<td>4 KB</td>\n<td>同步</td>\n<td>认证、小量数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>Cache API</td>\n<td>HTTP 式</td>\n<td>GB 级</td>\n<td>异步</td>\n<td>HTTP 响应缓存</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>IndexedDB</td>\n<td>对象数据库</td>\n<td>GB 级</td>\n<td>异步</td>\n<td>结构化数据存储</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>OPFS（私有文件系统）</td>\n<td>文件系统</td>\n<td>GB 级</td>\n<td>异步</td>\n<td>文件类数据</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>WebSQL</td>\n<td>SQL</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>-</td>\n<td>已废弃</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"为什么选择-indexeddb\">为什么选择 IndexedDB</h2><p><strong>超越 localStorage 的能力</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>localStorage：最大 5-10 MB，同步 API，只能存字符串。</li>\n<li>IndexedDB：数 GB 容量，异步 API，支持结构化对象存储。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>超越 Cache API 的能力</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>Cache API：专门存储 HTTP 请求/响应对。</li>\n<li>IndexedDB：存储任意结构化对象数据。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>典型使用场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>用户生成内容（笔记、草稿）。</li>\n<li>应用数据缓存（离线优先单页应用）。</li>\n<li>文件元数据和二进制大对象（Blob）。</li>\n<li>同步队列（离线操作排队等待上传）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"原生-indexeddb-api\">原生 IndexedDB API</h2><p><strong>打开数据库</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const request = indexedDB.open(&#39;myDB&#39;, 1);&#10;&#10;request.onupgradeneeded = (event) =&gt; {&#10;  const db = event.target.result;&#10;  const store = db.createObjectStore(&#39;tasks&#39;, { keyPath: &#39;id&#39;, autoIncrement: true });&#10;  store.createIndex(&#39;byStatus&#39;, &#39;status&#39;, { unique: false });&#10;};&#10;&#10;request.onsuccess = (event) =&gt; {&#10;  const db = event.target.result;&#10;  // 使用 db 进行操作&#10;};&#10;&#10;request.onerror = (event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.error(event.target.error);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const request = indexedDB.open('myDB', 1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>request.onupgradeneeded = (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const db = event.target.result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const store = db.createObjectStore('tasks', { keyPath: 'id', autoIncrement: true });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  store.createIndex('byStatus', 'status', { unique: false });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>request.onsuccess = (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  const db = event.target.result;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  // 使用 db 进行操作</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>request.onerror = (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.error(event.target.error);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>添加数据</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const tx = db.transaction(&#39;tasks&#39;, &#39;readwrite&#39;);&#10;const store = tx.objectStore(&#39;tasks&#39;);&#10;store.add({ title: &#39;Buy milk&#39;, status: &#39;pending&#39; });&#10;&#10;tx.oncomplete = () =&gt; console.log(&#39;Done&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const tx = db.transaction('tasks', 'readwrite');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const store = tx.objectStore('tasks');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>store.add({ title: 'Buy milk', status: 'pending' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tx.oncomplete = () => console.log('Done');</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>读取数据</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const tx = db.transaction(&#39;tasks&#39;, &#39;readonly&#39;);&#10;const store = tx.objectStore(&#39;tasks&#39;);&#10;const request = store.get(1);&#10;&#10;request.onsuccess = (event) =&gt; {&#10;  console.log(event.target.result);&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const tx = db.transaction('tasks', 'readonly');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const store = tx.objectStore('tasks');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const request = store.get(1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>request.onsuccess = (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log(event.target.result);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>通过索引查询</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const index = store.index(&#39;byStatus&#39;);&#10;const request = index.getAll(&#39;pending&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const index = store.index('byStatus');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const request = index.getAll('pending');</span></span></code></pre></div><p>原生 API 基于回调和事件驱动，代码冗长且容易出错。</p>\n<h2 id=\"现代封装库\">现代封装库</h2><p><strong>1. idb（Jake Archibald 开发）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>轻量级 Promise 封装。</li>\n<li>接近原生 API 的使用方式，学习成本低。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import { openDB } from &#39;idb&#39;;&#10;&#10;const db = await openDB(&#39;myDB&#39;, 1, {&#10;  upgrade(db) {&#10;    const store = db.createObjectStore(&#39;tasks&#39;, { keyPath: &#39;id&#39;, autoIncrement: true });&#10;    store.createIndex(&#39;byStatus&#39;, &#39;status&#39;);&#10;  },&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 添加数据&#10;await db.add(&#39;tasks&#39;, { title: &#39;Buy milk&#39;, status: &#39;pending&#39; });&#10;&#10;// 按主键获取&#10;const task = await db.get(&#39;tasks&#39;, 1);&#10;&#10;// 按索引查询&#10;const pending = await db.getAllFromIndex(&#39;tasks&#39;, &#39;byStatus&#39;, &#39;pending&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import { openDB } from 'idb';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const db = await openDB('myDB', 1, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  upgrade(db) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    const store = db.createObjectStore('tasks', { keyPath: 'id', autoIncrement: true });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    store.createIndex('byStatus', 'status');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 添加数据</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await db.add('tasks', { title: 'Buy milk', status: 'pending' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 按主键获取</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const task = await db.get('tasks', 1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 按索引查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const pending = await db.getAllFromIndex('tasks', 'byStatus', 'pending');</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>2. Dexie.js</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>更高层级的抽象封装。</li>\n<li>类似 ORM 的查询 API，支持链式调用。</li>\n<li>提供类型安全支持。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"import Dexie from &#39;dexie&#39;;&#10;&#10;const db = new Dexie(&#39;myDB&#39;);&#10;db.version(1).stores({&#10;  tasks: &#39;++id, status, createdAt&#39;,&#10;});&#10;&#10;// 添加&#10;await db.tasks.add({ title: &#39;Buy milk&#39;, status: &#39;pending&#39; });&#10;&#10;// 条件查询&#10;const pending = await db.tasks.where(&#39;status&#39;).equals(&#39;pending&#39;).toArray();&#10;&#10;// 更新&#10;await db.tasks.update(1, { status: &#39;done&#39; });&#10;&#10;// 删除&#10;await db.tasks.delete(1);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>import Dexie from 'dexie';</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const db = new Dexie('myDB');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>db.version(1).stores({</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  tasks: '++id, status, createdAt',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 添加</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await db.tasks.add({ title: 'Buy milk', status: 'pending' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 条件查询</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const pending = await db.tasks.where('status').equals('pending').toArray();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 更新</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await db.tasks.update(1, { status: 'done' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 删除</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await db.tasks.delete(1);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>3. PouchDB</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>基于 IndexedDB 并内置与 CouchDB 的同步能力。</li>\n<li>适合需要实时数据同步的场景。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>如何选择</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>需要轻量封装：选 idb。</li>\n<li>需要类似 ORM 的查询体验：选 Dexie.js。</li>\n<li>需要内置数据同步：选 PouchDB。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"数据模式设计\">数据模式设计</h2><p><strong>对象仓库（Object Store）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>类似关系型数据库中的表。</li>\n<li>按主键存储对象。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>主键路径（Key Path）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>指定对象中作为主键的属性。</li>\n<li>例：<code>{ keyPath: &#39;id&#39;, autoIncrement: true }</code> 表示以 <code>id</code> 字段自增作为主键。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>索引（Index）</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>为非主键字段创建二级索引，加速查询。</li>\n<li>例：<code>store.createIndex(&#39;byStatus&#39;, &#39;status&#39;)</code> 为 <code>status</code> 字段创建索引。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>数据模式迁移</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>递增版本号触发 <code>upgradeneeded</code> 事件。</li>\n<li>在升级回调中创建或修改对象仓库。</li>\n</ul>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const db = await openDB(&#39;myDB&#39;, 2, {&#10;  upgrade(db, oldVersion, newVersion, tx) {&#10;    if (oldVersion &lt; 1) {&#10;      const store = db.createObjectStore(&#39;tasks&#39;, { keyPath: &#39;id&#39; });&#10;      store.createIndex(&#39;byStatus&#39;, &#39;status&#39;);&#10;    }&#10;    if (oldVersion &lt; 2) {&#10;      // 迁移到版本 2：新增优先级索引&#10;      const store = tx.objectStore(&#39;tasks&#39;);&#10;      store.createIndex(&#39;byPriority&#39;, &#39;priority&#39;);&#10;    }&#10;  },&#10;});\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const db = await openDB('myDB', 2, {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  upgrade(db, oldVersion, newVersion, tx) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (oldVersion &#x3C; 1) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const store = db.createObjectStore('tasks', { keyPath: 'id' });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      store.createIndex('byStatus', 'status');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    if (oldVersion &#x3C; 2) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      // 迁移到版本 2：新增优先级索引</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      const store = tx.objectStore('tasks');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>      store.createIndex('byPriority', 'priority');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  },</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"事务机制\">事务机制</h2><p><strong>所有操作都在事务中执行</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const tx = db.transaction(&#39;tasks&#39;, &#39;readwrite&#39;);&#10;tx.objectStore(&#39;tasks&#39;).add({ ... });&#10;tx.objectStore(&#39;tasks&#39;).add({ ... });&#10;await tx.complete;  // 等待事务提交\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const tx = db.transaction('tasks', 'readwrite');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tx.objectStore('tasks').add({ ... });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tx.objectStore('tasks').add({ ... });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await tx.complete;  // 等待事务提交</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>事务模式</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li><code>readonly</code>：只读，不修改数据。</li>\n<li><code>readwrite</code>：读写模式。</li>\n<li><code>versionchange</code>：数据模式迁移专用。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>原子性保证</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>事务中的所有操作要么全部成功，要么全部回滚。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>跨仓库事务</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const tx = db.transaction([&#39;tasks&#39;, &#39;users&#39;], &#39;readwrite&#39;);&#10;tx.objectStore(&#39;tasks&#39;).add(...);&#10;tx.objectStore(&#39;users&#39;).put(...);&#10;await tx.complete;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const tx = db.transaction(['tasks', 'users'], 'readwrite');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tx.objectStore('tasks').add(...);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>tx.objectStore('users').put(...);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await tx.complete;</span></span></code></pre></div><pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TD&#10;    A[打开数据库] --&gt; B{版本匹配?}&#10;    B -- 否 --&gt; C[触发 upgradeneeded]&#10;    C --&gt; D[创建/迁移对象仓库]&#10;    D --&gt; E[就绪]&#10;    B -- 是 --&gt; E&#10;    E --&gt; F[开始事务]&#10;    F --&gt; G[执行操作]&#10;    G --&gt; H[提交]\">graph TD\n    A[打开数据库] --&gt; B{版本匹配?}\n    B -- 否 --&gt; C[触发 upgradeneeded]\n    C --&gt; D[创建/迁移对象仓库]\n    D --&gt; E[就绪]\n    B -- 是 --&gt; E\n    E --&gt; F[开始事务]\n    F --&gt; G[执行操作]\n    G --&gt; H[提交]</pre><h2 id=\"存储配额\">存储配额</h2><p><strong>浏览器配额限制</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>每个源（origin）大约可使用磁盘空间的 50%。</li>\n<li>与 Cache API 共享配额。</li>\n</ul>\n<p><strong>查询存储用量</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const { quota, usage } = await navigator.storage.estimate();&#10;console.log(`已使用: ${usage} / 配额: ${quota}`);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const { quota, usage } = await navigator.storage.estimate();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>console.log(`已使用: ${usage} / 配额: ${quota}`);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>申请持久化存储</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const granted = await navigator.storage.persist();\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const granted = await navigator.storage.persist();</span></span></code></pre></div><p>持久化存储获批后，浏览器在存储压力下不会驱逐该源的数据，适用于关键的离线应用数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"查询方式\">查询方式</h2><p><strong>按主键获取</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const task = await db.get(&#39;tasks&#39;, 1);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const task = await db.get('tasks', 1);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>获取全部</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const all = await db.getAll(&#39;tasks&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const all = await db.getAll('tasks');</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>范围查询</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const range = IDBKeyRange.bound(1, 10);&#10;const tasks = await db.getAll(&#39;tasks&#39;, range);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const range = IDBKeyRange.bound(1, 10);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const tasks = await db.getAll('tasks', range);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>索引查询</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const pending = await db.getAllFromIndex(&#39;tasks&#39;, &#39;byStatus&#39;, &#39;pending&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const pending = await db.getAllFromIndex('tasks', 'byStatus', 'pending');</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>游标遍历（适用于大数据集）</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const tx = db.transaction(&#39;tasks&#39;);&#10;let cursor = await tx.store.openCursor();&#10;while (cursor) {&#10;  console.log(cursor.value);&#10;  cursor = await cursor.continue();&#10;}\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const tx = db.transaction('tasks');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>let cursor = await tx.store.openCursor();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>while (cursor) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  console.log(cursor.value);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  cursor = await cursor.continue();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"排序\">排序</h2><p><strong>默认排序</strong>：按主键排序。</p>\n<p><strong>基于索引排序</strong>：索引字段自动按值排序，默认升序，可通过游标方向控制降序。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"let cursor = await tx.store.index(&#39;byStatus&#39;).openCursor(null, &#39;next&#39;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>let cursor = await tx.store.index('byStatus').openCursor(null, 'next');</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"批量操作\">批量操作</h2><p><strong>高效批量插入</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const tx = db.transaction(&#39;tasks&#39;, &#39;readwrite&#39;);&#10;for (const task of tasks) {&#10;  tx.store.add(task);&#10;}&#10;await tx.complete;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const tx = db.transaction('tasks', 'readwrite');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>for (const task of tasks) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  tx.store.add(task);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>await tx.complete;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>在单个事务中执行多次操作比每次操作都开启新事务要快得多。</p>\n<h2 id=\"blob-存储\">Blob 存储</h2><p><strong>存储文件或二进制大对象</strong>：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"await db.add(&#39;files&#39;, {&#10;  name: &#39;photo.jpg&#39;,&#10;  blob: file, // File 或 Blob 对象&#10;});&#10;&#10;const stored = await db.get(&#39;files&#39;, 1);&#10;const url = URL.createObjectURL(stored.blob);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>await db.add('files', {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  name: 'photo.jpg',</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  blob: file, // File 或 Blob 对象</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>});</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const stored = await db.get('files', 1);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>const url = URL.createObjectURL(stored.blob);</span></span></code></pre></div><p><strong>适用场景</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>下载的图片缓存（作为 Cache API 的替代方案）。</li>\n<li>用户上传的文件离线存储。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"事件驱动的数据更新\">事件驱动的数据更新</h2><p><strong>IndexedDB 本身不支持响应式数据监听</strong>：数据变更后不会自动通知其他标签页。</p>\n<p><strong>解决方案</strong>：使用 BroadcastChannel API 手动广播变更事件。</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"js\" data-code=\"const channel = new BroadcastChannel(&#39;tasks&#39;);&#10;&#10;async function addTask(task) {&#10;  await db.add(&#39;tasks&#39;, task);&#10;  channel.postMessage({ type: &#39;task-added&#39;, task });&#10;}&#10;&#10;// 其他标签页监听&#10;channel.onmessage = (event) =&gt; {&#10;  if (event.data.type === &#39;task-added&#39;) {&#10;    refreshUI();&#10;  }&#10;};\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span>const channel = new BroadcastChannel('tasks');</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>async function addTask(task) {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  await db.add('tasks', task);</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  channel.postMessage({ type: 'task-added', task });</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>}</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span></span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>// 其他标签页监听</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>channel.onmessage = (event) => {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  if (event.data.type === 'task-added') {</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>    refreshUI();</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>  }</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span>};</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"多标签页冲突\">多标签页冲突</h2><p><strong>多个标签页同时访问</strong>：IndexedDB 数据库在同源的所有标签页间共享，事务提供隔离。</p>\n<p><strong>可能出现竞态条件</strong>：标签页 A 读取数据 → 标签页 B 更新数据 → 标签页 A 基于旧数据写入。</p>\n<p><strong>解决方案</strong>：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>使用事务内原子更新。</li>\n<li>乐观并发控制（版本号检查）。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"性能优化建议\">性能优化建议</h2><p><strong>1. 批量事务</strong>：多个操作放入同一事务中执行更快。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 合理建索引</strong>：索引会减慢写入速度但加快查询；仅为频繁查询的字段建索引。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 大数据集使用游标</strong>：不要对百万条记录使用 <code>getAll</code>。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 重计算移至 Web Worker</strong>：避免在主线程处理大量数据阻塞界面。</p>\n<h2 id=\"安全注意事项\">安全注意事项</h2><p><strong>同源隔离</strong>：每个源拥有独立的数据库，无法跨源访问。</p>\n<p><strong>敏感数据处理</strong>：不要以明文存储密码或令牌，应使用 SubtleCrypto API 加密后存储。</p>\n<p><strong>用户清除</strong>：用户可通过浏览器设置清除所有存储数据。非持久化存储在存储压力下可能被浏览器自动清除。</p>\n<h2 id=\"浏览器兼容性\">浏览器兼容性</h2><p><strong>广泛支持</strong>：所有现代浏览器均支持 IndexedDB，包括 IE 10 及以上版本。</p>\n<p><strong>注意事项</strong>：Safari 的存储配额较小；各浏览器的存储策略有所不同。</p>\n<h2 id=\"常见反模式\">常见反模式</h2><p><strong>1. 直接使用原生 API</strong>：代码冗长且容易出错，应使用封装库。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 不使用事务</strong>：导致竞态条件和数据不一致。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 创建过多索引</strong>：严重拖慢写入性能。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 大数据集使用 getAll</strong>：可能耗尽内存，应使用游标遍历。</p>\n<p><strong>5. 不做数据模式迁移</strong>：版本升级时旧数据丢失或结构不兼容。</p>\n<p><strong>6. 明文存储敏感数据</strong>：浏览器存储默认未加密，需自行加密保护。</p>\n<h2 id=\"实战案例\">实战案例</h2><p><strong>Slack</strong>：使用 IndexedDB 缓存消息记录，支持离线查看最近对话。</p>\n<p><strong>Notion</strong>：大量使用缓存机制实现离线编辑。</p>\n<p><strong>Google Docs 离线模式</strong>：存储文档内容和编辑历史。</p>\n<h2 id=\"最佳实践\">最佳实践</h2><p><strong>1. 使用 Dexie.js 或 idb 封装库</strong>：避免直接使用原生 API 的复杂性。</p>\n<p><strong>2. 规划数据模式版本</strong>：提前设计好迁移策略。</p>\n<p><strong>3. 合理使用事务</strong>：批量操作保证原子性和性能。</p>\n<p><strong>4. 谨慎创建索引</strong>：仅为高频查询字段建索引。</p>\n<p><strong>5. 测试离线场景</strong>：验证真实离线环境下的数据读写。</p>\n<p><strong>6. 关键数据申请持久化</strong>：使用 <code>navigator.storage.persist()</code> 防止浏览器驱逐重要数据。</p>\n<h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><p>IndexedDB 是浏览器内置的 NoSQL 数据库——支持数 GB 容量、异步操作、索引查询和结构化对象存储，是离线优先 PWA 的数据基石（Cache API 负责 HTTP 缓存，IndexedDB 负责应用数据）。原生 API 基于回调且冗长，现代开发推荐使用封装库：idb 提供轻量 Promise 封装，Dexie.js 提供类 ORM 查询体验和类型安全支持，PouchDB 内置与 CouchDB 的同步能力。数据模式设计中，对象仓库类似数据表，主键路径指定唯一标识，索引加速非主键查询，版本递增触发迁移。事务保证原子性，支持跨仓库操作。存储配额约为磁盘空间的 50%，通过 <code>navigator.storage.estimate()</code> 检查用量，<code>persist()</code> 防止关键数据被驱逐。查询方式涵盖主键获取、范围查询、索引查询和游标遍历。批量操作应在单个事务中完成。Blob 存储支持文件和二进制数据。通过 BroadcastChannel 实现跨标签页数据变更通知。安全方面需注意同源隔离和敏感数据加密。掌握 IndexedDB 的关键在于：选对封装库、设计好数据模式和迁移策略、合理使用事务和索引、并为关键离线数据申请持久化存储。</p>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"IndexedDB 基础","id":"indexeddb-基础"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"为什么选择 IndexedDB","id":"为什么选择-indexeddb"},{"level":2,"text":"原生 IndexedDB API","id":"原生-indexeddb-api"},{"level":2,"text":"现代封装库","id":"现代封装库"},{"level":2,"text":"数据模式设计","id":"数据模式设计"},{"level":2,"text":"事务机制","id":"事务机制"},{"level":2,"text":"存储配额","id":"存储配额"},{"level":2,"text":"查询方式","id":"查询方式"},{"level":2,"text":"排序","id":"排序"},{"level":2,"text":"批量操作","id":"批量操作"},{"level":2,"text":"Blob 存储","id":"blob-存储"},{"level":2,"text":"事件驱动的数据更新","id":"事件驱动的数据更新"},{"level":2,"text":"多标签页冲突","id":"多标签页冲突"},{"level":2,"text":"性能优化建议","id":"性能优化建议"},{"level":2,"text":"安全注意事项","id":"安全注意事项"},{"level":2,"text":"浏览器兼容性","id":"浏览器兼容性"},{"level":2,"text":"常见反模式","id":"常见反模式"},{"level":2,"text":"实战案例","id":"实战案例"},{"level":2,"text":"最佳实践","id":"最佳实践"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"缓存失效","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/caching-strategies/cache-invalidation"},"next":{"title":"同步策略与冲突解决","url":"/l-doc-books/h/frontend/pwa-offline-first/offline-data/sync-strategies-and-conflict"}}